# Out onto the city's entry (as city.steps), then a full turn on the spot in eighths: looking back
# at the corridor, and the sky and the ground as you turn (the user's artefacts 3 and 4).
# Film it: tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps city_turn.steps
